    'menu.sure': 'Delete progress? Tap again', 'menu.nosave': 'No saved progress yet', 'menu.byeTitle': 'See you!', 'menu.byeText': 'Your progress is saved. You can close the tab or switch app. Next time you continue where you were.', 'menu.back': 'Back to menu', 'menu.menu': 'Main menu',
    'priv.title': 'Privacy', 'priv.back': 'BACK', 'priv.link': 'PRIVACY', 'priv.btn': 'PRIVACY',
    'priv.intro': 'Short and honest: what the game stores and sends. No login, no e-mail.',
    'priv.note': 'Sent to the developer. Do not write your name or other personal details.',
    'priv.saved.h': 'Stored on your device', 'priv.saved': 'Progress, badges, settings, difficulty, your builds and your tester code stay in your browser (on this device). They never leave the device by themselves.',
    'priv.sent.h': 'What is sent, and when', 'priv.sent': 'When you tap SEND yourself (feedback or report), or when you have a tester code and share a bridge, tick a fix or open replies. On top of that comes the anonymous statistics (below), which you can turn off.',
    'priv.contains.h': 'What it contains', 'priv.contains': 'The text you write, which level you are on, version, device type and OS version (for example «iPhone · iOS 17»), your settings, where in the level you were, frames per second and game events, your build as a code if the build screen is open (and how many parts are floor, beams and rope), and your tester code. Bridge codes and ticks only hold the code, the level and your choice.',
    'priv.stats.h': 'Anonymous statistics', 'priv.stats': 'Few events are sent without your name or tester code: a random id, version, mobile or PC and screen size (small, medium, large), level, time, points, how many times you went back to the checkpoint, build attempts, frames per second and short errors. Never position, text or pictures. We do not see your IP address, but the service may log it. It is OFF until you turn it on. Switch with the button below, or in ⚙.',
    'priv.stats.on': 'ANONYMOUS STATISTICS: ON (TAP TO TURN OFF)', 'priv.stats.off': 'ANONYMOUS STATISTICS: OFF (TAP TO TURN ON)',
    'priv.not.h': 'What it does not contain', 'priv.not': 'Name, e-mail, phone number, where you are in the world, pictures or camera. Do not write such things in the text either.',
    'priv.who.h': 'Who reads it', 'priv.who': 'The developer of the game (Rune), to fix bugs and improve the game. It is not passed on.',
    'priv.delete.h': 'Deleting it', 'priv.delete': 'Ask for deletion and give your tester code, and everything sent with that code is removed. What is stored on your device you delete yourself in ⚙ (Reset) or by clearing browser data.',
